    "description": "Pacific Color Costa Rica is an ongoing research initiative led by the Federaci\u00c3\u00b3n Costarricense de Pesca Tur\u00c3\u00adstica (FECOP), building upon the scientific collaborations established during the first sampling expedition Pacific Color 2025. The project aims to advance understanding of marine ecosystem dynamics along Costa Rica's Pacific coast by integrating field-based optical and biological measurements with hyperspectral satellite remote sensing, particularly observations from NASA's Plankton, Aerosol, Cloud, ocean Ecosystem (PACE) mission. The 2025 Pacific Color cruise data can be found under the PCOLOR2025 experiment and  more information about the project can be found through the program's official website.",
